# Build context for image/Dockerfile and mac-sandbox/Dockerfile is the repo root; only these reach the daemon.
*
!image/agent-network
!image/agent-network/**
!swarmkit
!swarmkit/**
!pyproject.toml
!README.md
# never the staged copy's local build products or git state
image/agent-network/.git
image/agent-network/node_modules
image/agent-network/**/node_modules
image/agent-network/**/dist
image/agent-network/**/*.tsbuildinfo
image/agent-network/runs
image/agent-network/docs/runs
**/__pycache__
**/.venv
